  "request_id": "sql-migration-registry-convergence-20261002",
  "title": "SQL migration registry convergence: restamp 15 repair-commit source hashes and retire 4 deleted SQLite/Qdrant migration rows",
  "summary": "Governor worklist items 12a/12b (2026-10-02), authorized decisions: governance restamp for source-hash mismatches and retirement of registry rows pointing to intentionally deleted SQLite/Qdrant migrations. Live evidence (migration-executor-status/v1, live gptbridge): 15 registry rows carry migration_source_hash values that no longer match on-disk files whose last-touch commits are exactly the governed repair commits e487bc473 and 99ba911f3; 4 rows (seq 25/37/45/46) point to files deleted by 26c63f79e (sqlite/qdrant retirement). This request (a) restamps migration_source_hash in sql_migration_registry and source_hash in sql_migration_authority_registry to the measured live file SHA-256 for the 15 rows, (b) retires the 4 deleted-source rows in both registries, and (c) rewires their successors' predecessor links so the chain stays topologically connected: seq 26 -> 24, 38 -> 36, 47 -> 44, with successor pre-state hashes set to the new predecessor's registered target_schema_hash (contiguous chain invariant preserved).",
  "requested_by": "decision-sovereign",
  "origin": "governor worklist decisions 2026-10-02 (AGENTS open items 12a+12b): governance restamp for the 15 source-hash mismatches caused by repair commits e487bc473/99ba911f3; retire registry rows 25/37/45/46 whose source files were deleted under the sqlite/qdrant retirement (commit 26c63f79e)",
  "problem": {
    "summary": "sql_migration_registry and sql_migration_authority_registry diverge from current source truth: 15 rows stamp migration_source_hash values predating repair commits e487bc473/99ba911f3 (executor reports SQL_SCHEMA_VERSION_MISMATCH at verify-live-source-hash), and 4 rows reference migration files deleted by sqlite/qdrant retirement commit 26c63f79e (SOURCE_FILE_MISSING). Live gptbridge has 0 migration receipts; the executor chain currently fails closed at every mismatched row and would halt permanently at the deleted-file rows.",
    "affected": ["sql_migration_registry", "sql_migration_authority_registry"],
    "scope": "registry convergence only: source-hash restamp, deleted-row retirement, successor predecessor rewiring in both registries; no live migration application, no file changes, no target_schema_hash re-derivation"
  },
  "change_class": "provision-scope",
  "required_review": "five-sovereign-audit-unanimous-pass",
  "flow": "A382/A488-non-disruptive-amendment-flow",
  "not_executed": true,
